/-- The boundary of the standard `(n+1)`-simplex, as a function-space model:
nonnegative functions on `Fin (n+2)` summing to 1 with some coordinate 0. -/
def SimplexBoundaryFn (n : ℕ) : Set (Fin (n + 2) → ℝ) :=
  {s | 0 ≤ s ∧ (∑ i, s i) = 1 ∧ 0 ∈ Set.range s}
```

