```lean
def simplexCenter (n : ℕ) : ℝ := ((n + 2 : ℕ) : ℝ)⁻¹
lemma simplexCenter_pos (n) : 0 < simplexCenter n := inv_pos.mpr (Nat.cast_pos.mpr (by norm_num... n+2 > 0))
```

